      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{VII} Gif hwa on cirican hwæt geðeofige, forgylde þæt angylde, ⁊ ðæt wite swa to ðam angylde belimpan wille, ⁊ slea mon þa hond óf ðe he hit mid gedyde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone steals something from a church, let him pay for it single-fold, and the fine such as is appropriate to the single-payment, and let the hand be struck off with which he did it.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone steals anything from a church, he shall pay the value of the article and the fine which is appropriate to the the value in question, and the hand shall be struck off which committed the theft.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">VII. Gif hwa on cirican hwæt geþeofige, forgylde ðæt angylde, ⁊ þæt wíte swa to þam angylde belimpan wille, ⁊ slea mon þa hond of ðe he hit mid [stæl] dyde.</ab>
      </div>
